---
description: Dashboard line charts use the lookup modal and date-time X-axis
globs: src/components/dashboard/**/*.{tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

Trend-style line charts (TrendChart, AnalyticsChart, and future copies) must:

- Put period/hour selection in `SnapshotLookup`, not `1D/7D/1M` chip rows
- Use `AxisDateTimeTick` for X-axis labels: `MM/DD` on the first line, 24-hour `HH:mm` on the second
- Share the same lookup state from `useDashboard` (`selectedFrom`, `selectedTo`, `selectedHours`)
